{"id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-function-tree.md","title":"部分可计算函数树","display":"df-function-tree — 部分可计算函数树","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-function-tree","aliases":["20-df-function-tree"],"display":"df-function-tree — 部分可计算函数树","chapter":"12","section":"12.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 12.1.2","source_pdf_pages":[227],"source_printed_pages":[197],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-function-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-function-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function-tree — 部分可计算函数树"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 12.1.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>227</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>197</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 部分可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;2\">\\(i&lt;2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\alpha\\\n[(T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\lor T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow)\\Rightarrow\n(T(\\alpha)\\downarrow\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow\n\\land T(\\alpha)\\prec T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\land T(\\alpha)\\prec T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\n\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\perp T(\\alpha^\\frown1))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\alpha\\\n[(T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\lor T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow)\\Rightarrow\n(T(\\alpha)\\downarrow\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow\n\\land T(\\alpha)\\prec T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\land T(\\alpha)\\prec T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\n\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\perp T(\\alpha^\\frown1))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>函数树是从域串到值串的映射，不是向下闭合的串集合。只要定义任一子节点，另一个子节点及父节点也必须定义。全函数树的值域向下闭包为普通可计算二进制树。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.1.2；印刷页 197；PDF 第 227 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"i<2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\alpha\\\n[(T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\lor T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow)\\Rightarrow\n(T(\\alpha)\\downarrow\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow\n\\land T(\\alpha)\\prec T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\land T(\\alpha)\\prec T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\n\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\perp T(\\alpha^\\frown1))].","display":true}],"bytes":1468,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]。"},{"id":"05d82ffd170fb7a6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435","3f7915f8f8ad037c","e343870c773cb68e"]}